{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或依常例，改唱鑪香讚亦可。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若當處者，即改云當寺或本寺。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是隨機勸誘，臨\n時自述，不必誦語。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此偈闍梨一人直聲自說。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此偈和尚一人直聲自說。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋見《資持記》，今節錄。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "由慧得脫，由脫具知見。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "本圖說為妙蓮法師依教作贈"}
{"id": null, "n": "0535b0601", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0535b0601", "type": "add", "text": "土【CB】，十【佛教】"}
